  "html": "<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":2445,\"mediaLink\":\"https://divergentjournaler.com/?attachment_id=2445\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"mediaType\":\"image\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_0226-1024x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2445 size-full\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Content…\"} -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Note to self : This started as a watercolor flower.. I began at the outside with lighter (near transparent) petals and worked my way to center. There was a plan... and then I dropped a pen. :/</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Supplies Used :Posca, Derwent Inktense Watercolor, Micron .3 </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
